WEBVTT

00:00:23.636 --> 00:00:25.072
[CHIRPING]

00:00:25.116 --> 00:00:26.247
[GRUNTS]

00:00:28.641 --> 00:00:29.772
[SIGHS]

00:00:33.037 --> 00:00:34.212
Ta-da!

00:00:34.255 --> 00:00:35.430
[SIGHS]

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:37.432
[YELLING GIBBERISH]

00:00:37.476 --> 00:00:38.651
[YELPING]

00:00:39.695 --> 00:00:41.175
Whoa, whoa!

00:00:41.219 --> 00:00:43.003
Cavies!
"Cavies"?
洞穴人 -「洞穴人」

00:00:43.047 --> 00:00:45.658
Cavemen! Stand back!
They're practically animals.
洞穴人 后退 他们根本是动物

00:00:45.701 --> 00:00:48.400
You see their bony,
sloping foreheads?
Yeah.
你看他们骨头突出 倾斜的前额

00:00:48.443 --> 00:00:50.924
The huge
primitive teeth?
[GROWLS]
还有又大又原始的牙齿

00:00:51.359 --> 00:00:52.491
Yeah.
对啊

00:00:52.534 --> 00:00:54.406
The excessive body hair.
还有过多的体毛

00:00:54.449 --> 00:00:55.668
Oh... That one
has got a tail.
那一个还有尾巴

00:00:55.711 --> 00:00:57.409
Yeah.
对啊

00:00:57.452 --> 00:00:59.715
All right. Close your eyes.
I'm going to have
to take their lives.
好了 眼睛闭上 我要杀了他们

00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:02.718
No! It won't help.
They're my family.
不行 这样不好 他们是我的家人

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:04.503
What?
[GROWLING]
什么

00:01:04.546 --> 00:01:06.853
[YELPS] The sun
is in his hands!
他的手里有太阳

00:01:06.896 --> 00:01:09.377
No, no.
It's "fire."
不是 这是「火」

00:01:09.421 --> 00:01:10.857
Where did it
come from?
那是从哪里来的

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:12.380
He made it.
他做的

00:01:12.424 --> 00:01:13.555
Make some for me!
帮我做一点

00:01:13.599 --> 00:01:15.035
It doesn't
come out of him.
[GRUNTS]
不是从他身体里来的

00:01:15.079 --> 00:01:16.558
Make. Make it!
快点做 快点

00:01:16.602 --> 00:01:18.038
[BONES CRACKING]

00:01:18.082 --> 00:01:20.562
[RASPING] You're a lot
like your daughter.
你跟你女儿好像

00:01:20.606 --> 00:01:22.216
Oh! Great,
now he's broken.
很好 现在他坏掉了

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:24.523
Ooh!
It's a baby sun.
那是太阳宝宝

00:01:24.566 --> 00:01:27.221
Whoa! Hey, stay back.
We don't know what it wants.
后退 我们不知道它要什么

00:01:27.265 --> 00:01:30.224
Now, we'll all sit here
and wait for the sun
to come back.
现在大家坐下 等太阳回来

00:01:30.268 --> 00:01:32.879
And tomorrow
we'll find a new cave...
明天我们就会找新洞穴

00:01:32.922 --> 00:01:35.708
and pretend
today never happened.
假装今天的事都没发生

00:01:35.751 --> 00:01:37.101
Isn't this fun, Eep?
很好玩吧 一妹

00:01:37.144 --> 00:01:38.537
Eep,
don't touch him.
一妹 不要碰他

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:40.060
Goodness knows
where he's been.
天知道他去过哪里

00:01:40.104 --> 00:01:42.628
THUNK: Dad,
Sandy is hurting fire.
老爸 珊蒂在欺负火

00:01:42.671 --> 00:01:45.631
Sandy, no.
Fire is not a plaything.
珊蒂不可以 火不是拿来玩的

00:01:45.674 --> 00:01:47.241
Aw! What
a cute little guy.
真是个可爱的东西

00:01:47.285 --> 00:01:49.113
Oh, hey.
Stay back.
喂 后退

00:01:49.156 --> 00:01:50.375
[SCREAMS]

00:01:51.202 --> 00:01:53.204
No, no, no, wait!
不 不行 等一下

00:01:53.247 --> 00:01:54.379
[COUGHING]

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:57.382
It likes me.
它喜欢我

00:01:57.425 --> 00:01:58.905
Hey!
It's biting me!
唉呀 它咬我

00:01:58.948 --> 00:02:00.863
[SCREAMS]
[STAMMERS]
坦克 快躲到又高又干的草丛

00:02:00.907 --> 00:02:04.389
Thunk! Try hiding from it
in the tall, dry grass!
坦克 快躲到又高又干的草丛

00:02:04.432 --> 00:02:05.607
[YELPING]

00:02:08.045 --> 00:02:10.090
No, stop.
Please, I'm only nine.
不要 别这样 拜托 我才九岁

00:02:10.134 --> 00:02:11.222
They're biting me!
它们在咬我

00:02:11.265 --> 00:02:12.745
[CHUCKLES]

00:02:12.788 --> 00:02:13.963
[GASPS] Oh...

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:16.270
More fire babies.
火宝宝变多了

00:02:16.314 --> 00:02:17.358
[GASPS]
你醒了

00:02:17.402 --> 00:02:18.533
Hi.
你醒了

00:02:18.577 --> 00:02:20.840
So, your dad,
he is trying to kill me.
所以你老爸想杀了我

00:02:20.883 --> 00:02:22.755
Yeah.
But I won't let him.
对 但我不会让他这么做

00:02:22.798 --> 00:02:24.757
[GRUNTS]
撑住 儿子 快回来

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:26.367
[THUNK SCREAMING]
GRUG: Hold on, son.
Come back!
撑住 儿子 快回来

00:02:27.934 --> 00:02:29.370
No, stop!
Let me go!
不 停下来 让我走

00:02:30.632 --> 00:02:32.808
Get out!
Out! Out!
快出去 出去 快走

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:35.550
Eat up, babies!
看我的 你们这些宝宝

00:02:35.594 --> 00:02:37.422
Ooh...
GRAN: No, stop touching me!
不要再碰我了

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:39.511
Die!
受死吧

00:02:40.207 --> 00:02:41.295
[SIZZLES]

00:02:41.817 --> 00:02:43.602
I win!
我赢了

00:02:44.168 --> 00:02:45.125
[SCREAMING]

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:47.475
[BOTH SCREAMING]

00:02:50.261 --> 00:02:52.872
They're not so scary
once you get to know them.
跟他们熟一点就知道他们没那么可怕

00:02:52.915 --> 00:02:53.916
Uh... Uh...

00:02:54.569 --> 00:02:56.702
Who are you people?
你们是谁

00:02:56.745 --> 00:02:58.225
Oh, I'm sorry.
抱歉

00:02:58.269 --> 00:03:00.749
We're the Croods!
我们是古鲁家族

00:03:00.793 --> 00:03:02.011
And you are?
你又是谁

00:03:02.664 --> 00:03:03.796
Uh, Guy.
我叫阿盖

00:03:03.839 --> 00:03:05.276
ALL: Hi, Guy.
阿盖 你好

00:03:05.319 --> 00:03:06.581
[ALL SCREAMING]
阿盖 你好

00:03:17.592 --> 00:03:18.767
[ALL GASP]
哇

00:03:18.811 --> 00:03:19.812
ALL: Wow!
哇

00:03:20.421 --> 00:03:22.162
It looks like magic.
看起来好像魔法

00:03:22.206 --> 00:03:24.425
[SNIFFING]
And smells like food.
闻起来好像食物

00:03:25.383 --> 00:03:26.384
ALL: Oh!

00:03:29.126 --> 00:03:30.170
THUNK: Whoa...
不 不要吃 那是新东西

00:03:30.214 --> 00:03:33.173
GRUG: No,
don't eat it, it's new.
不 不要吃 那是新东西

00:03:37.221 --> 00:03:38.787
ALL: Still alive!
我们还活着

00:03:38.831 --> 00:03:40.702
GUY: Come on,
keep eating.
别停 继续吃

00:03:41.312 --> 00:03:42.835
[CHITTERING]

00:03:44.315 --> 00:03:46.012
EEP: Hey,
where is Guy?
对了 阿盖在哪里

00:03:46.055 --> 00:03:47.100
[GASPS]

00:03:47.144 --> 00:03:48.319
[PANTING]

00:03:48.362 --> 00:03:49.668
[EEP GROWLING]

00:03:52.584 --> 00:03:53.715
GUY: No!
不要

00:03:53.759 --> 00:03:55.152
Going somewhere?
你要去哪里

00:03:55.195 --> 00:03:57.589
The mountain? High ground?
End of the world, remember?
去山上 高处 世界末日 记得吗

00:03:57.632 --> 00:04:00.766
That already happened.
It destroyed our cave.
末日已经发生了 我们的洞穴被毁了

00:04:00.809 --> 00:04:03.290
No. That was just
the beginning of the end.
不是 那只是末日的开始

00:04:03.334 --> 00:04:05.901
The end of the end
is still coming.
末日的结局还没来

00:04:05.945 --> 00:04:08.077
Eep. Drop it.
一妹 把那个放下来

00:04:09.253 --> 00:04:10.384
[GRUNTING]

00:04:11.211 --> 00:04:12.908
We can't let him go!
我们不能让他走

00:04:12.952 --> 00:04:16.216
What if we don't find
a cave before sunset?
如果我们在日落前

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:18.697
What if it takes
a few days?
如果要花好几天怎么办

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:21.090
[GASPS] What if
the birds come back?
如果那些鸟又回来怎么办

00:04:22.701 --> 00:04:26.661
We need his fire,
dummy!
我们需要他的火 笨蛋

00:04:26.705 --> 00:04:29.925
Fine.
You're staying with us
until we find a cave.
好 在我们找到洞穴之前

00:04:29.969 --> 00:04:33.059
What? No, I'm not.
Don't make me
a part of this!
什么 我不要 我才不要跟你们一伙

00:04:33.102 --> 00:04:35.235
Ooh! Stay here
if you want,
but let me go.
你想要就留下来 但放我走吧

00:04:35.279 --> 00:04:36.497
I've got a dream...
我有一个梦想

00:04:36.541 --> 00:04:38.717
a mission,
a reason to live!
一个任务 一个活下来的理由

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:40.022
Not anymore.
现在没有了

00:04:40.066 --> 00:04:41.850
Um, I've got an idea.
我有个点子

00:04:41.894 --> 00:04:43.939
Let's go
to that mountain.
我们去那座山

00:04:43.983 --> 00:04:45.158
It's too far.
太远了

00:04:45.202 --> 00:04:48.030
Dad really has his
heart set on a cave.
老爸早就打定主意要住在洞穴里

00:04:48.074 --> 00:04:49.118
[GROANS]

00:04:49.162 --> 00:04:51.730
There are caves
on that mountain.
那座山上有洞穴

00:04:51.773 --> 00:04:53.166
[GASPS]
Have you been there?
你去过吗

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:54.341
It's a mountain.
那是一座山

00:04:54.385 --> 00:04:56.865
Mountains are safe.
Mountains have caves.
山很安全 山一定有洞穴

00:04:56.909 --> 00:04:59.041
And water. And sticks.
还有水 还有棍子

00:04:59.085 --> 00:05:01.740
Mom? Did you hear that?
I can get my own stick!
妈 你听到了吗 我会有自己的棍子

00:05:01.783 --> 00:05:04.308
Yes. Sticks and caves.
Caves and sticks.
对 棍子和洞穴 洞穴和棍子

00:05:04.351 --> 00:05:05.570
Crazy sticks.
Let's go.
疯狂的棍子 我们走吧

00:05:05.613 --> 00:05:07.441
[SHUSHES]
Quiet!
闭嘴

00:05:08.355 --> 00:05:09.574
[RUMBLING]

00:05:09.617 --> 00:05:10.792
[ANIMAL TRUMPETS]

00:05:10.836 --> 00:05:11.837
[GASPS]

00:05:12.533 --> 00:05:13.926
Dun-dun-dun!

00:05:15.275 --> 00:05:16.450
[GROWLS]

00:05:18.104 --> 00:05:19.453
Ugh!
That thing is weird.
那东西很奇怪

00:05:21.542 --> 00:05:23.544
No, no, no.
It's okay, Sandy.
不 没事的 珊蒂

00:05:23.588 --> 00:05:24.980
That's just Belt.
那只是皮带而已

00:05:25.024 --> 00:05:26.112
[GROWLS]

00:05:28.984 --> 00:05:30.377
Uh, I've made a decision.
我决定了

00:05:30.421 --> 00:05:33.424
We're going
to that mountain.
我们要去...那座山

00:05:33.467 --> 00:05:35.730
Don't ask me why.
Just a hunch.
不要问我为什么 只是直觉而已

00:05:35.774 --> 00:05:37.558
Just feels right.
感觉应该没错

00:05:37.602 --> 00:05:40.822
I don't know, Grug.
We've never really
walked that far.
我们从没走过这么远

00:05:40.866 --> 00:05:43.042
I don't think
my feet can do that.
我觉得我的脚做不到

00:05:43.085 --> 00:05:45.740
I'll never live long
enough to get there.
我走到那里都老死了吧

00:05:46.698 --> 00:05:48.090
Let's do it.
我们走吧

00:05:48.874 --> 00:05:51.093
Oh, come on,
just think.
别这样 想想看

00:05:51.137 --> 00:05:52.965
Our whole family
packed together
我们全家人一起

00:05:53.008 --> 00:05:55.272
on a long, slow,
trip across country?
进行长途 缓慢的徒步旅行喔

00:05:55.315 --> 00:05:57.317
Days and nights
with just each other.
[GRUNTS]
白天与黑夜都在一起

00:05:57.361 --> 00:05:59.101
We'll tell stories.
We'll laugh.
我们会说故事 会大笑

00:05:59.145 --> 00:06:00.494
Ha-ha-ha!
[GRUNTS]
我们会说故事 会大笑

00:06:00.538 --> 00:06:04.063
We'll become
closer as a family.
我们全家的感情会更好

00:06:04.106 --> 00:06:05.760
[GROWLING]
[GASPS]
把她抓下来

00:06:05.804 --> 00:06:06.935
[SCREAMS] Get her off!
把她抓下来

00:06:06.979 --> 00:06:07.980
If you're not ready
to challenge her,
如果你还没准备好挑战她

00:06:08.023 --> 00:06:09.155
then don't look
her in the eye.
就不要看她的眼睛

00:06:09.198 --> 00:06:10.983
Could you keep
your big giant arms
让你的粗手臂好好走

00:06:11.026 --> 00:06:12.637
on your side
of the trail?
[GRUNTS]
不要弄到我 好吗

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:16.684
Isn't this fun?
We're taking our
first trip together.
我们第一次一起旅行耶

00:06:16.728 --> 00:06:18.512
Stop shoving,
or I will pull
out your tongue!
不要吵 不然我就拔掉你的舌头

00:06:18.556 --> 00:06:20.862
Do you want me to turn
this family around?
Do you?
你们不想继续前进了吗

00:06:20.906 --> 00:06:23.691
Because I will
turn this family
around so fast!
我马上就能回头喔

00:06:23.735 --> 00:06:25.476
Dad, I gotta go!
老爸 我要尿尿

00:06:25.519 --> 00:06:27.782
Come on,
you can hold it.
I don't think so.
别这样 你忍得住的 -我不觉得

00:06:27.826 --> 00:06:29.131
UGGA: Sandy, take
that out of your mouth.
珊蒂 嘴巴里的东西拿出来

00:06:29.175 --> 00:06:30.394
GRAN: I'm touching--
EEP: Gran.
我要摸... -妈

00:06:30.437 --> 00:06:33.005
THUNK: Dad,
I still gotta go!
老爸 我还是得尿尿

00:06:33.048 --> 00:06:36.269
GRUG: Fine. Just go
behind one of those lumpy
things and make it fast.
好啦 去那堆东西后面 动作快

00:06:36.313 --> 00:06:38.227
THUNK: Something bit me!
GRAN: I don't blame it.
有东西咬我 -应该的

00:06:38.271 --> 00:06:40.795
EEP: Dad, can I take
a turn carrying him?
老爸 可以轮到我抓他吗

00:06:40.839 --> 00:06:41.970
GRUG: No.
不行

00:06:42.014 --> 00:06:43.581
EEP: How about now?
GRUG: No.
现在呢 -不行

00:06:43.624 --> 00:06:44.886
EEP: Now?
GRUG: No.
现在呢 -不行

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:46.061
EEP: [SHOUTS] Now?
现在呢

00:06:46.105 --> 00:06:48.455
GRUG: I can do this
all day long.
我可以抓着他一整天

00:06:48.499 --> 00:06:51.893
No, no, no
and still no.
不 不行...还是不行

00:06:51.937 --> 00:06:54.243
I'm not dying on
an empty stomach.
我不想饿着肚子死掉

00:06:54.287 --> 00:06:56.724
Grug,
we're all pretty tired!
咕噜 我们很累了

00:06:56.768 --> 00:06:58.247
We'll eat
when we get there.
我们到那里就可以吃东西了

00:06:58.291 --> 00:06:59.858
It's taking too long!
那太久了

00:06:59.901 --> 00:07:02.426
I'm grabbing a snack.
我要吃点心

00:07:02.469 --> 00:07:04.384
Don't do that.
He will cut you.
不要这样 他会割伤你

00:07:04.428 --> 00:07:06.386
That's not food,
he's a pet. My pet.
那不是食物 是宠物 我的宠物

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:07.692
What's a pet?
什么是「宠物」

00:07:07.735 --> 00:07:09.563
An animal you don't eat.
你不会吃掉的动物

00:07:09.607 --> 00:07:11.696
[CHUCKLES ]We call
those "children."
那应该是「小孩」

00:07:11.739 --> 00:07:13.001
[GROWLING]
没有人应该养宠物

00:07:13.045 --> 00:07:16.440
No man should have a pet.
It's weird and wrong.
没有人应该养宠物

00:07:17.310 --> 00:07:19.268
It's food!
No, please!
这是食物 -不要 求你

00:07:19.312 --> 00:07:21.096
Not that. That!
不是那个 是那个

00:07:22.663 --> 00:07:24.317
Food fixes everything.
食物可以解决所有问题

00:07:24.361 --> 00:07:26.188
Show me your hunting face.
给我看你打猎的脸

00:07:26.232 --> 00:07:27.799
[MUMBLING]

00:07:27.842 --> 00:07:29.931
[ROARS]
Not you.
You're still grounded.
不是你 你还在禁足

00:07:29.975 --> 00:07:31.411
Come on, Thunk.
过来 坦克

00:07:31.455 --> 00:07:33.108
[GROANS]
My feet hurt.
我的脚好痛

